nt-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CDil!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffbda48f4-7e1c-40dc-9c2f-603fc0dd484f_640x411.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CDil!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffbda48f4-7e1c-40dc-9c2f-603fc0dd484f_640x411.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CDil!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffbda48f4-7e1c-40dc-9c2f-603fc0dd484f_640x411.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CDil!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffbda48f4-7e1c-40dc-9c2f-603fc0dd484f_640x411.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CDil!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffbda48f4-7e1c-40dc-9c2f-603fc0dd484f_640x411.jpeg\" width=\"640\" height=\"411\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/fbda48f4-7e1c-40dc-9c2f-603fc0dd484f_640x411.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:411,&quot;width&quot;:640,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:26095,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CDil!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffbda48f4-7e1c-40dc-9c2f-603fc0dd484f_640x411.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CDil!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffbda48f4-7e1c-40dc-9c2f-603fc0dd484f_640x411.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CDil!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffbda48f4-7e1c-40dc-9c2f-603fc0dd484f_640x411.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!CDil!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ffbda48f4-7e1c-40dc-9c2f-603fc0dd484f_640x411.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg role=\"img\" style=\"height:20px;width:20px\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><title></title><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>可以明显的看出来，后面两张都是电脑合成的，不是实拍照片。第一张的“光环”看起来也是一个模型。</p><p>为什么土星相对较近，拍摄机会很多，照片之间的却间隔这么久，间隔了 10 年，20 年才“拍摄”一张。而那些非常远的“宇宙边沿星系”，却有大量的“高清”照片呢？我觉得那是因为没人见过那些“宇宙边沿星系”，它们也许根本就不存在，所以可以随便电脑合成出来。</p><p>“哈勃太空望远镜”是不存在的，就像其它的太空计划一样，都是假的。太空里根本不存在什么“哈勃”和“韦伯”，它们都只是摄影棚里的模型而已。不信的话，可以去看看这几个“维修哈勃望远镜”的视频，你能在背景的黑色太空中看见一颗星星吗？</p><ul><li><p>第 1 次维修任务：</p></li></ul><div id=\"youtube2-2X0Hghl3SYk\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;2X0Hghl3SYk&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/2X0Hghl3SYk?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div><ul><li><p>第 2 次维修任务：</p></li></ul><div id=\"youtube2-j4r4rS5aafo\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;j4r4rS5aafo&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/j4r4rS5aafo?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div><ul><li><p>第 3 次维修任务：</p></li></ul><div id=\"youtube2-oo_1aW6eceI\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;oo_1aW6eceI&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/oo_1aW6eceI?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div><ul><li><p>，</p></li></ul><div id=\"youtube2-ckjh5CBsi2w\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;ckjh5CBsi2w&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/ckjh5CBsi2w?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div><ul><li><p>第 4 次维修任务：</p></li></ul><div id=\"youtube2-xgbUbdC6kbo\" class=\"youtube-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;videoId&quot;:&quot;xgbUbdC6kbo&quot;,&quot;startTime&quot;:null,&quot;endTime&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"Youtube2ToDOM\"><div class=\"youtube-inner\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/xgbUbdC6kbo?rel=0&amp;autoplay=0&amp;showinfo=0&amp;enablejsapi=0\" frameborder=\"0\" loading=\"lazy\" gesture=\"media\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" allowautoplay=\"true\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" width=\"728\" height=\"409\"></iframe></div></div><p>当然，执行这些维修任务的“航天飞机”也是假的，这些视频都是摄影棚里用绿幕拍的。当年把哈勃望远镜送上太空的“发现者”号航天飞机，也是假的。航天飞机也全都是假的，就是这么简单。</p><h3>地面天文台拍摄的土星照片</h3><p>搜索地面的天文台实拍的土星照片，根本找不到那些最大的天文台拍的。搜索结果基本被“哈勃”的电脑合成图片给淹没了。</p><p>实拍的照片只能找到这样一张<a href=\"https://www.scottcountyiowa.gov/conservation/wapsi/education/menke-observatory\">美国某村的小天文台</a>拍的。这照片比较模糊，有可能是真的。但这还是比天文爱好者们的望远镜清晰了太多，另外注意它的纯黑背景，那个方向的其它星星去哪里了？所以这“照片”可能同样是假的。</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mOXO!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8294ec36-2cf8-49f3-bbd9-4da485c94c83_640x414.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mOXO!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8294ec36-2cf8-49f3-bbd9-4da485c94c83_640x414.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mOXO!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8294ec36-2cf8-49f3-bbd9-4da485c94c83_640x414.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mOXO!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8294ec36-2cf8-49f3-bbd9-4da485c94c83_640x414.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mOXO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8294ec36-2cf8-49f3-bbd9-4da485c94c83_640x414.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mOXO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8294ec36-2cf8-49f3-bbd9-4da485c94c83_640x414.jpeg\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/8294ec36-2cf8-49f3-bbd9-4da485c94c83_640x414.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:null,&quot;width&quot;:null,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:70482,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mOXO!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8294ec36-2cf8-49f3-bbd9-4da485c94c83_640x414.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mOXO!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8294ec36-2cf8-49f3-bbd9-4da485c94c83_640x414.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mOXO!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8294ec36-2cf8-49f3-bbd9-4da485c94c83_640x414.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mOXO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F8294ec36-2cf8-49f3-bbd9-4da485c94c83_640x414.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div></div></div></a></figure></div><p></p>",
